{"v":2,"s":"m","w":7,"steps":[{"t":"read","h":"Special products","b":"<div class=\"fx\">(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b²</div><div class=\"fx\">(a − b)² = a² − 2ab + b²</div><div class=\"fx\">(a − b)(a + b) = a² − b²</div><div class=\"fx\">a³ − b³ = (a − b)(a² + ab + b²)   a³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² − ab + b²)</div><div class=\"callout\">A square garden of side a, enlarged by b on two sides: the new area is a², plus two strips ab, plus a small corner b².</div><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b² — the square, the two strips and the small corner.\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"ahc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"a\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"60\" y=\"10\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\" rx=\"0\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"70\" class=\"on\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\">a²</text><rect x=\"172\" y=\"10\" width=\"44\" height=\"110\" rx=\"0\" class=\"a2\"/><text x=\"194\" y=\"70\" >ab</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"122\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"0\" class=\"a2\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"149\" >ab</text><rect x=\"172\" y=\"122\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" rx=\"0\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"194\" y=\"149\" class=\"on\">b²</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"182\" >a</text><text x=\"194\" y=\"182\" >b</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"70\" >a</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"149\" >b</text></svg><figcaption>(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b² — the square, the two strips and the small corner.</figcaption></figure>"},{"t":"read","h":"Factoring","b":"<p><b>Factoring</b> (rastavljanje na činioce) turns a sum into a product. Try in this order:</p><ol><li>Common factor: 3x² + 6x = 3x(x + 2)</li><li>Difference of squares: 9a² − 1 = (3a − 1)(3a + 1)</li><li>Perfect square: x² − 6x + 9 = (x − 3)²</li><li>Trinomial x² + bx + c: find two numbers with product c and sum b. x² − x − 6 = (x − 3)(x + 2)</li><li>Grouping for four terms</li></ol>"},{"t":"ex","q":"Factor 2x³ − 8x completely.","s":["Common factor first: 2x(x² − 4).","x² − 4 is a difference of squares: (x − 2)(x + 2)."],"a":"2x(x − 2)(x + 2)"},{"t":"mc","q":"(x − 5)² = ?","o":["x² − 25","x² − 10x + 25","x² + 25","x² − 5x + 25"],"a":1,"e":"a² − 2ab + b²."},{"t":"mc","q":"Factor 9a² − 1:","o":["(9a − 1)(a + 1)","(3a − 1)²","(3a − 1)(3a + 1)","9(a² − 1)"],"a":2,"e":"(3a)² − 1²."},{"t":"mc","q":"Factor 3x² + 6x:","o":["3(x² + 2x)","3x(x + 2)","x(3x + 6)","3x(x + 6)"],"a":1,"e":"Take out everything common: 3x."},{"t":"mc","q":"Factor x² − x − 6:","o":["(x − 3)(x + 2)","(x + 3)(x − 2)","(x − 6)(x + 1)","(x − 1)(x + 6)"],"a":0,"e":"−3 · 2 = −6 and −3 + 2 = −1."},{"t":"num","q":"101² − 99² = ? (no calculator)","a":400,"u":"","e":"(101 − 99)(101 + 99) = 2 · 200 = 400."}]}